WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.334 --> 00:00:03.136
The latest now in our breaking news.

00:00:03.136 --> 00:00:03.570
The U.S.

00:00:03.570 --> 00:00:04.804
military has shot down

00:00:04.804 --> 00:00:06.940
another high altitude object,

00:00:06.940 --> 00:00:08.675
this tank near Lake Huron.

00:00:08.675 --> 00:00:09.743
This would be the third

00:00:09.743 --> 00:00:11.745
object brought down in as many days.

00:00:11.911 --> 00:00:13.646
Let's go now to CNN's Arlette Sines

00:00:13.646 --> 00:00:14.581
at the White House.

00:00:14.581 --> 00:00:14.948
Our let

00:00:14.948 --> 00:00:17.150
you have new details about this object.

00:00:17.283 --> 00:00:18.551
What are you learning?

00:00:18.718 --> 00:00:19.285
Yeah, Paula,

00:00:19.285 --> 00:00:19.586
a senior

00:00:19.586 --> 00:00:20.887
administration official

00:00:20.887 --> 00:00:22.922
providing some new details to myself,

00:00:22.922 --> 00:00:24.057
Natasha Bertrand and Phil

00:00:24.057 --> 00:00:26.159
Mattingly detailing what exactly

00:00:26.326 --> 00:00:28.561
this unidentified object look like now.

00:00:28.728 --> 00:00:31.598
It was flying at about 20,000 feet

00:00:31.731 --> 00:00:32.899
when it was shot down.

00:00:32.899 --> 00:00:35.702
It had been flying over part of

00:00:36.736 --> 00:00:38.304
Michigan's Upper Peninsula

00:00:38.304 --> 00:00:40.407
and then was nearing Lake Huron

00:00:40.407 --> 00:00:41.007
when ultimately

00:00:41.007 --> 00:00:43.476
it was taken down by fighter aircraft.

00:00:43.476 --> 00:00:45.145
And what this senior administration

00:00:45.145 --> 00:00:46.312
official described

00:00:46.312 --> 00:00:46.579
is that

00:00:46.579 --> 00:00:48.615
it had an octagonal shape

00:00:48.615 --> 00:00:50.650
and there were strings hanging from it,

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:52.419
but with no discernible payload.

00:00:52.419 --> 00:00:53.053
Another source

00:00:53.053 --> 00:00:53.953
who was briefed on the matter

00:00:53.953 --> 00:00:56.056
also shared that description.

00:00:56.056 --> 00:00:56.990
And while the U.S.

00:00:56.990 --> 00:00:57.223
has said

00:00:57.223 --> 00:00:58.158
that they can't

00:00:58.158 --> 00:00:58.958
happen, determined

00:00:58.958 --> 00:00:59.692
whether they're

00:00:59.692 --> 00:01:00.360
whether there was

00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:02.195
any intelligence collection

00:01:02.195 --> 00:01:04.230
capabilities to this object,

00:01:04.364 --> 00:01:06.099
they are simply not ruling that out

00:01:06.099 --> 00:01:06.900
at this moment.

00:01:06.900 --> 00:01:09.035
Now, this object was first detected

00:01:09.035 --> 00:01:12.005
by Noor Rod and Noor Cam just last night.

00:01:12.305 --> 00:01:13.840
There was some radar contact

00:01:13.840 --> 00:01:14.974
that was made in the US

00:01:14.974 --> 00:01:16.843
that sent some fighter aircraft

00:01:16.843 --> 00:01:17.777
to try to take a look

00:01:17.777 --> 00:01:19.479
and see if there was anything out there

00:01:19.479 --> 00:01:20.113
last night

00:01:20.113 --> 00:01:22.182
that they did not see an object

00:01:22.315 --> 00:01:23.583
and ultimately believed

00:01:23.583 --> 00:01:25.652
that it was an anomaly, a radar anomaly.

00:01:25.652 --> 00:01:26.553
But then today

00:01:26.553 --> 00:01:27.954
they reacquired

00:01:27.954 --> 00:01:31.391
that radar contact and found this object

00:01:31.558 --> 00:01:35.261
that was going from Wisconsin over in

00:01:35.295 --> 00:01:36.096
to Michigan.

00:01:36.096 --> 00:01:37.330
Now, there were concerns

00:01:37.330 --> 00:01:38.865
about the height of this aircraft.

00:01:38.865 --> 00:01:40.767
It was flying at 20,000 feet

00:01:40.767 --> 00:01:41.968
and also its path.

00:01:41.968 --> 00:01:43.303
So there had been concerns

00:01:43.303 --> 00:01:45.071
about what it might mean

00:01:45.071 --> 00:01:47.273
for civilian aircraft, but officials

00:01:47.273 --> 00:01:48.775
say that it did not pose

00:01:48.775 --> 00:01:49.809
any imminent threat

00:01:49.809 --> 00:01:50.944
to people on the ground.

00:01:50.944 --> 00:01:52.946
But ultimately, President Biden

00:01:52.946 --> 00:01:54.080
followed the advice

00:01:54.080 --> 00:01:55.381
of his military leaders

00:01:55.381 --> 00:01:57.851
and ordered that this unidentified object

00:01:57.851 --> 00:01:58.818
be shot down.

00:01:58.818 --> 00:02:01.087
So that is what transpired today.

00:02:01.087 --> 00:02:02.388
But just a step back.

00:02:02.388 --> 00:02:03.590
This is just the latest

00:02:03.590 --> 00:02:05.558
in a series of remarkable events

00:02:05.558 --> 00:02:07.327
over the course of the last eight days.

00:02:07.327 --> 00:02:09.562
This is the fourth time that the U.S.

00:02:09.562 --> 00:02:10.697
has shot down

00:02:10.697 --> 00:02:11.965
an aerial object

00:02:11.965 --> 00:02:13.633
in North American airspace,

00:02:13.633 --> 00:02:15.735
starting with that Chinese spy balloon

00:02:15.735 --> 00:02:17.403
which traversed across the country.

00:02:17.403 --> 00:02:18.037
For days

00:02:18.037 --> 00:02:19.339
and was ultimately shot down

00:02:19.339 --> 00:02:20.740
off the Carolina coast.

00:02:20.740 --> 00:02:22.242
Now, there is this trio

00:02:22.242 --> 00:02:24.010
of unidentified objects

00:02:24.010 --> 00:02:25.745
with very few descriptors

00:02:25.745 --> 00:02:27.046
and big questions

00:02:27.046 --> 00:02:28.982
about where exactly they came from

00:02:28.982 --> 00:02:30.984
and who they belong to.

00:02:30.984 --> 00:02:32.018
The two objects

00:02:32.018 --> 00:02:33.086
that were shot down

00:02:33.086 --> 00:02:34.120
on Friday

00:02:34.120 --> 00:02:35.021
and then Saturday,

00:02:35.021 --> 00:02:37.023
we still have very limited details

00:02:37.023 --> 00:02:38.358
in what exactly

00:02:38.358 --> 00:02:41.427
these objects contained and looked like.

00:02:41.594 --> 00:02:42.595
Officials here have said

00:02:42.595 --> 00:02:43.997
that they were smaller than that

00:02:43.997 --> 00:02:45.365
Chinese spy balloon

00:02:45.365 --> 00:02:46.766
that was shot down

00:02:46.766 --> 00:02:48.635
off the waters of the East Coast.

00:02:48.635 --> 00:02:50.403
But certainly so many questions

00:02:50.403 --> 00:02:51.771
for this administration.

00:02:51.771 --> 00:02:53.006
As we have just seen.

00:02:53.006 --> 00:02:54.340
Unidentified object

00:02:54.340 --> 00:02:56.142
after an unidentified object

00:02:56.142 --> 00:02:57.911
entering U.S. airspace.

00:02:57.911 --> 00:02:58.711
And there's questions

00:02:58.711 --> 00:02:59.712
about where they came from

00:02:59.712 --> 00:03:01.014
and what exactly it all means.

00:03:02.048 --> 00:03:03.550
So many questions are left sides.

00:03:03.550 --> 00:03:04.651
Thank you.

00:03:05.084 --> 00:03:05.852
And let's talk

00:03:05.852 --> 00:03:06.452
more about this

00:03:06.452 --> 00:03:08.821
with CNN military analyst, retired U.S.

00:03:08.821 --> 00:03:09.722
Air Force Force

00:03:09.722 --> 00:03:10.723
Colonel Cedric

00:03:10.723 --> 00:03:12.158
Leighton and CNN's

00:03:12.158 --> 00:03:13.593
national security analyst

00:03:13.593 --> 00:03:16.262
Juliette Kayyem. All right.

00:03:16.262 --> 00:03:18.298
Colonel, thank you for being with us.

00:03:18.298 --> 00:03:21.534
What is your reaction to this?

00:03:21.534 --> 00:03:22.835
Well, this is really interesting.

00:03:22.835 --> 00:03:24.737
And our reporting is

00:03:24.737 --> 00:03:26.372
is really piqued my interest,

00:03:26.372 --> 00:03:28.007
because what you're seeing here

00:03:28.007 --> 00:03:29.175
is something that we

00:03:29.175 --> 00:03:31.177
I don't think we've seen before

00:03:31.177 --> 00:03:33.246
and octagonal object.

00:03:33.246 --> 00:03:35.348
So I don't know if that's the payload

00:03:35.582 --> 00:03:38.551
or if that's actually the balloon or

00:03:38.551 --> 00:03:40.453
the propulsion system or,

00:03:40.453 --> 00:03:41.821
you know, something else like that.

00:03:41.821 --> 00:03:43.323
So we don't have very many details,

00:03:43.323 --> 00:03:45.291
but these are the kinds of questions

00:03:45.291 --> 00:03:47.093
that we definitely have to be asking.

00:03:47.093 --> 00:03:48.294
And then the other thing that

00:03:48.294 --> 00:03:48.661
I thought

00:03:48.661 --> 00:03:49.395
was interesting

00:03:49.395 --> 00:03:51.531
from this octagonal object.

00:03:52.232 --> 00:03:53.833
We have strings coming out.

00:03:53.833 --> 00:03:55.935
The strings could be all kinds of things.

00:03:55.935 --> 00:03:57.537
But I'm looking at the possibility

00:03:57.537 --> 00:03:58.671
of those strings

00:03:58.671 --> 00:04:00.707
being antennas of one type or another,

00:04:00.707 --> 00:04:02.242
either for receiving

00:04:02.242 --> 00:04:04.744
or for transmitting information.

00:04:04.744 --> 00:04:05.011
Sheet.

00:04:05.011 --> 00:04:06.713
So that's the kind of step

00:04:06.713 --> 00:04:08.147
that we have to analyze,

00:04:08.147 --> 00:04:09.115
have to have the DOD

00:04:09.115 --> 00:04:11.017
and other forensic specialists

00:04:11.017 --> 00:04:12.118
analyze this

00:04:12.118 --> 00:04:14.520
and really take a look at

00:04:14.520 --> 00:04:16.990
what this system actually is,

00:04:16.990 --> 00:04:17.790
how it connects

00:04:17.790 --> 00:04:18.691
with other

00:04:18.691 --> 00:04:19.592
the other systems

00:04:19.592 --> 00:04:21.794
that were shot down earlier.

00:04:22.262 --> 00:04:23.563
If it does connect at all.

00:04:23.563 --> 00:04:24.964
Those are the kinds of questions

00:04:24.964 --> 00:04:25.932
that I have right now.

00:04:25.932 --> 00:04:28.067
Else and one other thing, if I may.

00:04:28.067 --> 00:04:29.736
And that's the low ELT,

00:04:29.736 --> 00:04:30.970
relatively low altitude

00:04:30.970 --> 00:04:32.572
that this thing was flying at.

00:04:32.572 --> 00:04:34.440
12,000 feet is absolute

00:04:34.440 --> 00:04:35.642
lutely within

00:04:35.642 --> 00:04:37.477
the realm of commercial aircraft.

00:04:37.477 --> 00:04:39.345
And that's extremely dangerous

00:04:39.345 --> 00:04:41.047
from a commercial aviation perspective.

00:04:41.047 --> 00:04:42.215
And the skies over

00:04:42.215 --> 00:04:44.150
Michigan are fairly well populated.

00:04:44.150 --> 00:04:45.351
So it's definitely something

00:04:45.351 --> 00:04:47.153
that needs to be taken care of.

00:04:47.153 --> 00:04:47.687
And Juliette,

00:04:47.687 --> 00:04:49.155
I want to get your reaction to this.

00:04:49.155 --> 00:04:50.923
Another day, another shoot down of

00:04:50.923 --> 00:04:52.025
the so-called object.

00:04:53.760 --> 00:04:54.994
And so

00:04:55.295 --> 00:04:56.663
I want to put this in the categories

00:04:56.663 --> 00:04:58.164
of what we know and what we don't know.

00:04:58.164 --> 00:04:59.966
So what we know

00:04:59.966 --> 00:05:02.402
is that since the Chinese balloon

00:05:02.402 --> 00:05:05.905
incident a week ago and learn of other

00:05:06.439 --> 00:05:07.140
infiltrations

00:05:07.140 --> 00:05:08.341
by the Chinese of the balloon

00:05:08.341 --> 00:05:10.810
in years past,

00:05:10.810 --> 00:05:11.978
essentially NORAD's,

00:05:11.978 --> 00:05:14.347
NORTHCOM and other agencies essentially

00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:15.214
what were you call

00:05:15.214 --> 00:05:15.782
opened up

00:05:15.782 --> 00:05:17.116
the aperture of what

00:05:17.116 --> 00:05:18.284
they were looking for.

00:05:18.284 --> 00:05:19.786
So they are

00:05:19.786 --> 00:05:22.155
they're getting lots of positives

00:05:22.155 --> 00:05:23.856
that they did not get before

00:05:23.856 --> 00:05:27.560
most of that is going to be known

00:05:27.560 --> 00:05:29.696
to known the airplanes, whatever it

00:05:29.762 --> 00:05:30.897
whatever it may be.

00:05:30.897 --> 00:05:32.699
But there are now going to be lots

00:05:32.699 --> 00:05:34.100
more things that sort of raise

00:05:34.100 --> 00:05:35.435
the level of concern.

00:05:35.435 --> 00:05:38.037
So so that's the first thing we know.

00:05:38.037 --> 00:05:38.271
These

00:05:38.271 --> 00:05:40.173
these positives

00:05:40.173 --> 00:05:42.375
were anticipated more positive.

00:05:42.375 --> 00:05:44.944
What we can't answer now is,

00:05:45.178 --> 00:05:47.814
is this sort of bigger aperture

00:05:48.181 --> 00:05:49.015
picking up

00:05:49.015 --> 00:05:50.183
lots of stuff

00:05:50.183 --> 00:05:53.152
that has essentially been forgiven

00:05:53.152 --> 00:05:53.686
sort of

00:05:53.953 --> 00:05:55.121
around in the skies,

00:05:55.121 --> 00:05:56.122
whatever else it is,

00:05:56.122 --> 00:05:58.124
because they didn't pose a threat

00:05:58.124 --> 00:06:00.927
or is it part of something organized

00:06:01.561 --> 00:06:03.563
for whatever surveillance I do want to.

00:06:03.563 --> 00:06:04.997
So so we don't know.

00:06:04.997 --> 00:06:06.799
And I would just want to pick up on

00:06:06.799 --> 00:06:07.934
on what the congressman

00:06:07.934 --> 00:06:09.335
who was on before us

00:06:09.335 --> 00:06:11.270
to speculate about China

00:06:11.270 --> 00:06:12.638
in all of these incidents

00:06:12.638 --> 00:06:14.841
is just it's it's I'm sorry.

00:06:14.841 --> 00:06:16.409
It is just not right right now.

00:06:16.409 --> 00:06:18.644
We do not know what these objects are.

00:06:18.644 --> 00:06:21.114
They are two are described as VW sized.

00:06:21.114 --> 00:06:22.782
One is now of tango.

00:06:22.782 --> 00:06:23.883
We we don't know if there's

00:06:23.883 --> 00:06:25.351
balloons attached to them.

00:06:25.351 --> 00:06:27.320
So we need to just sort of understand

00:06:27.320 --> 00:06:27.887
what's going on.

00:06:27.887 --> 00:06:28.554
There is a

00:06:28.554 --> 00:06:30.957
there's a wider lens of surveillance

00:06:31.224 --> 00:06:32.759
that is picking up things.

00:06:32.759 --> 00:06:34.560
We don't quite know what they are.

00:06:34.560 --> 00:06:36.662
And our tolerance for it

00:06:36.662 --> 00:06:38.664
after what happened with China is lower.

00:06:38.664 --> 00:06:39.799
We're going to shoot it down

00:06:39.799 --> 00:06:42.168
if it is unmanned, if it is it

00:06:42.168 --> 00:06:43.803
if it's hurting commercial

00:06:43.803 --> 00:06:46.205
or a threat to commercial aviation,

00:06:46.205 --> 00:06:47.473
and if shooting it down

00:06:47.473 --> 00:06:49.809
will not harm Americans in the homeland,

00:06:50.076 --> 00:06:51.177
that is essentially

00:06:51.177 --> 00:06:52.412
what's going on

00:06:52.412 --> 00:06:53.579
at the speculation

00:06:53.579 --> 00:06:56.215
is really premature at this stage.

00:06:56.215 --> 00:06:56.849
And Colonel,

00:06:56.849 --> 00:06:57.583
you talked a little bit

00:06:57.583 --> 00:06:59.218
about civilian airspace.

00:06:59.218 --> 00:07:01.320
Clearly, these could potentially pose

00:07:01.320 --> 00:07:02.955
a threat to civilian aviation.

00:07:02.955 --> 00:07:04.590
Is there any way to really secure

00:07:04.590 --> 00:07:06.726
the skies against these kinds of objects?

00:07:08.127 --> 00:07:09.662
Well, it's certainly a challenge, Paula.

00:07:09.662 --> 00:07:10.563
And, you know,

00:07:10.563 --> 00:07:11.798
we look at

00:07:11.798 --> 00:07:14.233
how we've secured the skies in the past

00:07:14.233 --> 00:07:16.402
we've sometimes used draconian measures

00:07:16.402 --> 00:07:17.804
such as shutting things down

00:07:17.804 --> 00:07:20.239
in the wake of nine 11, for example,

00:07:20.239 --> 00:07:22.375
until we had a reasonable handle on

00:07:22.842 --> 00:07:24.844
what was flying in our airspace.

00:07:24.844 --> 00:07:25.878
I certainly

00:07:25.878 --> 00:07:27.313
don't advocate anything like that

00:07:27.313 --> 00:07:28.448
at this particular point

00:07:28.448 --> 00:07:29.248
in time, though,

00:07:29.248 --> 00:07:31.484
the danger to commercial aviation is,

00:07:31.717 --> 00:07:34.020
I would say, minimal at this point.

00:07:34.020 --> 00:07:35.922
But it is something that has to be taken

00:07:35.922 --> 00:07:36.956
into account.

00:07:36.956 --> 00:07:40.092
And airmen of all types, civilian

00:07:40.092 --> 00:07:41.093
as well as military,

00:07:41.093 --> 00:07:42.762
have to be on the lookout

00:07:42.762 --> 00:07:44.464
for unusual objects.

00:07:44.464 --> 00:07:44.997
Right now.

00:07:44.997 --> 00:07:46.566
I think the heightened awareness

00:07:46.566 --> 00:07:48.234
on the part of everybody

00:07:48.234 --> 00:07:50.470
becomes really important.

00:07:50.470 --> 00:07:53.072
But having an iron clad, you know,

00:07:53.239 --> 00:07:55.274
control mechanism for face,

00:07:55.274 --> 00:07:57.276
that's practically an impossibility.

00:07:57.276 --> 00:07:59.378
But we can certainly do a better job

00:07:59.378 --> 00:08:01.447
knowing what's in the air.

00:08:01.447 --> 00:08:03.516
And I think North has certainly dealt

00:08:03.516 --> 00:08:05.284
with a ton at this point in time,

00:08:05.284 --> 00:08:06.118
a little bit late,

00:08:06.118 --> 00:08:07.720
but still better late than never.

